<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="RevaampAPA Terms of Service — the terms governing your use of our real estate aggregation, promotion, agency and project management platform.">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/css/switzer.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/css/font-awesome.min.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/bootstrap-grid.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/swiper.min.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/custom.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
</head>

<body>
    <div id="smooth-wrapper" class="mil-wrapper">
        <div class="mil-preloader"><div class="mil-load"></div><p class="h2 mil-mb-30"><span class="mil-light mil-counter" data-number="100">100</span><span class="mil-light">%</span></p></div>
        <div class="mil-progress-track"><div class="mil-progress"></div></div>
        <div class="progress-wrap active-progress"></div>

        <div class="mil-top-panel">
            <div class="container">
                <a href="/" class="mil-logo"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="RevaampAPA" width="83" height="32"></a>
                <nav class="mil-top-menu">
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/properties">Properties</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/hotels">Hotels</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/projects">Projects</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
                <div class="mil-menu-buttons">
                    <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
                        <div class="dropdown" style="position: relative;">
                            <a href="#" class="mil-btn mil-sm dropdown-toggle" data-bs-toggle="dropdown">
                                <i class="fa fa-user-circle"></i> <%= user.name %>
                            </a>
                            <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                                <li><a href="/dashboard"><i class="fa fa-tachometer"></i> Dashboard</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/logout"><i class="fa fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Logout</a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/login" class="mil-btn mil-sm">Log in</a>
                        <a href="/register" class="mil-btn mil-sm mil-light">Get Started</a>
                    <% } %>
                    <div class="mil-menu-btn"><span></span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="smooth-content">
            <div class="mil-banner mil-banner-inner mil-dissolve">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-xl-8">
                            <div class="mil-banner-text mil-text-center">
                                <h1 class="mil-mb-30">Terms of Service</h1>
                                <p class="mil-text-m mil-soft">Last updated: June 2026</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mil-blog-list mil-p-80-80">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-xl-9 mil-legal">
                            <p>Welcome to RevaampAPA. These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the RevaampAPA platform, including our website, applications, and related services (collectively, the "Platform"). By accessing or using the Platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p>

                            <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
                            <p>By creating an account, listing a property, subscribing to a service, or otherwise using the Platform, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms and our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, you must not use the Platform.</p>

                            <h3>2. Eligibility</h3>
                            <p>You must be at least 18 years old and capable of forming a legally binding contract to use the Platform. Where you act on behalf of an organisation, you represent that you are authorised to bind that organisation to these Terms.</p>

                            <h3>3. Accounts and Roles</h3>
                            <p>The Platform supports multiple roles, including property owners, promoters, agents, business partners, solicitors, architects and project management subscribers. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for all activity that occurs under your account. Certain roles require approval and/or verification before access is granted.</p>

                            <h3>4. Listings, Projects and Verification</h3>
                            <p>Users who list properties or propose projects are responsible for the accuracy, legality and completeness of the information they submit. RevaampAPA may, but is not obliged to, verify listings, documents, bank guarantees and professional credentials. Verification does not constitute a warranty by RevaampAPA as to the condition, title, value or suitability of any property or project.</p>

                            <h3>5. Fees and Payments</h3>
                            <p>Some services attract fees, including listing verification fees, subscription fees and service fees. Applicable fees are presented before you commit to a transaction. Payments are processed through third-party providers, and you agree to their terms in addition to ours. Except where required by law, fees are non-refundable.</p>

                            <h3>6. Professional Services</h3>
                            <p>Solicitors and architects onboarded to the Platform provide independent professional services. RevaampAPA facilitates introductions and workflow but is not a party to, and accepts no liability for, the professional advice, legal opinions or structural assessments provided by such professionals.</p>

                            <h3>7. Acceptable Use</h3>
                            <p>You agree not to misuse the Platform, including by submitting false information, infringing intellectual property, attempting to gain unauthorised access, or using the Platform for any unlawful purpose.</p>

                            <h3>8. Limitation of Liability</h3>
                            <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, RevaampAPA shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential losses arising from your use of the Platform. The Platform is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis.</p>

                            <h3>9. Changes to These Terms</h3>
                            <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be notified through the Platform. Continued use after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

                            <h3>10. Contact</h3>
                            <p>Questions about these Terms may be directed to <a href="mailto:info@revaampapa.com">info@revaampapa.com</a>.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <footer class="mil-p-80-0">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="mil-footer-bottom">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-xl-6"><p class="mil-text-s mil-soft">© 2026 RevaampAPA. All rights reserved.</p></div>
                            <div class="col-xl-6"><p class="mil-text-s mil-text-right mil-sm-text-left mil-soft"><a href="/privacy" class="mil-soft">Privacy</a> · <a href="/cookies" class="mil-soft">Cookies</a></p></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/plugins/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/swiper.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/ScrollSmoother.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/ScrollTo.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/magnific-popup.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>

    <style>
        .dropdown-menu { display: none; }
        .dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu { display: block; }
        .mil-legal h3 { margin: 30px 0 12px; }
        .mil-legal p { margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
    </style>
</body>

</html>
